# {{name}}

One sentence saying what this assembly is for.

![maturity](https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-planned-lightgrey) ![license](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT%20OR%20Apache--2.0%20OR%20MulanPSL--2.0-blue)

Part of the [Tape-Out]({{org}}) IP library, assembled by [`xirang`]({{org}}/xirang).

## Status

Planned. An assembly carries no RTL of its own: it lists instances, gives each one an
address, and `xirang` generates the top level and the address map. The skeleton holds a
single 8-pin GPIO reached over the external APB4 port. Replace it.

